      <cyrillic>бушуу</cyrillic>
      <transcript>BUSIΓU</transcript>
      <definition>[=bisiγu]. adj. and adv, Prompt[ly], quick[ly], alert; diligent.</definition>
      <page>140</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠣᠰᠢᠭᠣ ᠠᠮᠠᠲᠠᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- amatai</transcript>
          <definition> Quick at repartee.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠣᠰᠢᠭᠣ ᠪᠡᠷ</unicode>
          <transcript>--ber </transcript>
          <definition> Hastily, swiftly, quickly.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠣᠰᠢᠭᠣ ᠭᠦᠶᠦᠵᠦ ᠢᠷᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- gyjyzy ireky</transcript>
          <definition> 'To come running.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠣᠰᠢᠭᠣ ᠺᠦᠮᠦᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- kymyn</transcript>
          <definition> A swift person.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠣᠰᠢᠭᠣ ᠲᠠᠰᠢᠭᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- tasiγu</transcript>
          <definition> Quick, swift, nimble.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
